      "section_heading": "Practical learning. A clearer next step.",
      "heading_level": "h2",
      "eyebrow": "The program",
      "subheading": "",
      "description": "Most companies don't need their whole engineering team retrained from scratch. They need the two or three people who are stuck between what they learned in college and what the current project actually uses. This program is built for that gap.\n\nWe pick the stack based on what you're running: MEAN or MERN if you're a JavaScript shop, .NET or Java if you're on the Microsoft or enterprise side, Python with Django and MySQL if that's closer to home. The sessions are hands-on from day one; nobody's just watching slides.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The program",
