      "section_id": "trainingfullstackdevelopment_06_detail_section",
      "section_order": 6,
      "html_id": null,
      "element": "section",
      "section_name": "Detail Section",
      "section_heading": "Good questions.",
      "heading_level": "h2",
      "eyebrow": "A little more clarity",
      "subheading": "",
      "description": "",
      "paragraphs": [
        "A little more clarity",
        "Yes, where practical, and under NDA if required. Exercises can be built around scenarios that resemble your actual repositories and conventions, which is usually where the training sticks best.",
        "It's usually better to run two focused batches than one diluted one, and we'll tell you honestly which your situation calls for. Migration-focused sessions (for example Angular to React) are a common middle path.",
        "Depends on depth: a focused framework-migration sprint can run one intensive week; a full end-to-end program typically runs multi-week around your delivery calendar. You'll get a proposed schedule with the quote."
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A little more clarity"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Good questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Can you train our team on our own codebase?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Yes, where practical, and under NDA if required. Exercises can be built around scenarios that resemble your actual repositories and conventions, which is usually where the training sticks best."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Our team is split between two stacks. Can one batch cover both?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "It's usually better to run two focused batches than one diluted one, and we'll tell you honestly which your situation calls for. Migration-focused sessions (for example Angular to React) are a common middle path."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "How long does the program take?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Depends on depth: a focused framework-migration sprint can run one intensive week; a full end-to-end program typically runs multi-week around your delivery calendar. You'll get a proposed schedule with the quote."
        }
